  Drill, MCQ and NEI calibrated against the Paper 1 legislation-recognition
  pattern. NEI scenario built around indirect discrimination plus a parallel
  reasonable-adjustments duty, since the indirect-discrimination concept is
  where Paper 1 candidates most often floor out.
